        {
          "properties": {
            "paragraphs": [
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "HOW TO READ THIS PAGE",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1A9E8F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "5pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "What it shows",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The full-year revenue outlook as a RANGE, built from explicit assumptions and compared with the target (budget).",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "5pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "How the scenarios are built",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Base = actual Jan–Oct + forecast Nov–Dec",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Downside = base − all risks",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Upside = base + all opportunities",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Risk-weighted = base − Σ(risk × prob.) + Σ(opp. × prob.)",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "5pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Try this",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Base is 6.05M vs a 5.75M budget: ahead, mainly thanks to the 300k change order.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Pick Downside: if both batch risks and the stability slip hit, we land at 5.38M, below target.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "• Set the what-if to −20: Nov–Dec drops from 1.46M to 1.17M and the base outlook falls to 5.76M, just above target.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": " ",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "5pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Say it in one line",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "10pt",
                      "color": "#1F3A5F",
                      "fontWeight": "bold"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "\"I present the outlook as a range with the assumptions behind it, so the business review discusses the risks, not just one number.\"",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#1F2937"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
